# Every text file is checked out with LF, on Windows too (D-111): Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which turned the golden files, the //go:build lines the tests read and the
# hack/ scripts bash runs into CRLF on a Windows checkout and failed them there. Git decides what is
# text; nothing in the repository needs CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
